            <sparkle:version>144</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **Reorder projects.** Drag a project up or down in the sidebar, or use Move Up and Move Down in its context menu. The order is kept; new projects go to the bottom.
- **Fold sessions by clicking the project.** Clicking a project shows its board; clicking it again while its board is on screen folds or opens its sessions. A double click from a terminal shows the board with the sessions folded.

### Changed
- **Simpler sidebar.** Each project takes one line with its name and status dots; hover it to see the folder path. Session rows are quieter, and an open project gets a little space below its sessions.
]]></description>
